16:["$","p","At undergraduate level, large entrance awards are highly selective and usually require early admission applications or school nomination.",{"children":"At undergraduate level, large entrance awards are highly selective and usually require early admission applications or school nomination."}]
17:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Compare gross funding with tuition and city costs",{"children":"Compare gross funding with tuition and city costs"}],["$","li","Ask whether funding is guaranteed each year",{"children":"Ask whether funding is guaranteed each year"}],["$","li","Check supervisor contact expectations",{"children":"Check supervisor contact expectations"}],["$","li","Review province-specific study requirements",{"children":"Review province-specific study requirements"}],["$","li","Confirm award eligibility for international status",{"children":"Confirm award eligibility for international status"}]]}]
18:["$","section","How AspireCompass verifies listings",{"id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How AspireCompass verifies listings"}],[["$","p","We summarise eligibility, funding and timing from the programme owner whenever an official page is available. Every listing shows the source and the date it was last checked.",{"children":"We summarise eligibility, funding and timing from the programme owner whenever an official page is available. Every listing shows the source and the date it was last checked."}],["$","p","Scholarship and recruitment details can change without notice. Always read the official call, confirm the deadline in your time zone and apply through the programme owner's portal. AspireCompass does not award scholarships or charge an application fee.",{"children":"Scholarship and recruitment details can change without notice. Always read the official call, confirm the deadline in your time zone and apply through the programme owner's portal. AspireCompass does not award scholarships or charge an application fee."}]],"$undefined"]}]
19:["$","section","Separate undergraduate awards from graduate funding packages",{"id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Separate undergraduate awards from graduate funding packages"}],[["$","p","Major undergraduate awards can require nomination before the normal application closes. For the University of Toronto's 2027 Lester B. Pearson cycle, the official page lists a school-nomination deadline, an admission deadline and a later scholarship-application deadline. Missing the first step cannot be repaired by submitting only the scholarship form.",{"children":"Major undergraduate awards can require nomination before the normal application closes. For the University of Toronto's 2027 Lester B. Pearson cycle, the official page lists a school-nomination deadline, an admission deadline and a later scholarship-application deadline. Missing the first step cannot be repaired by submitting only the scholarship form."}],["$","p","Research master's and doctoral funding is often assembled by the university or department from an entrance award, supervisor grant and teaching or research work. Compare the written package after tuition and mandatory fees, and ask whether each component is guaranteed or conditional.",{"children":"Research master's and doctoral funding is often assembled by the university or department from an entrance award, supervisor grant and teaching or research work. Compare the written package after tuition and mandatory fees, and ask whether each component is guaranteed or conditional."}]],"$undefined"]}]
1a:["$","section","Questions to ask before accepting Canadian funding",{"id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Questions to ask before accepting Canadian funding"}],[["$","p","Read the offer and programme handbook together. A headline annual amount may include employment that has separate hours, duties and renewal rules.",{"children":"Read the offer and programme handbook together. A headline annual amount may include employment that has separate hours, duties and renewal rules."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Is the quoted amount before or after tuition?",{"children":"Is the quoted amount before or after tuition?"}],["$","li","How many years are guaranteed?",{"children":"How many years are guaranteed?"}],["$","li","Are teaching or research hours included?",{"children":"Are teaching or research hours included?"}],["$","li","Does funding continue during fieldwork or leave?",{"children":"Does funding continue during fieldwork or leave?"}],["$","li","Which health-insurance and student fees remain?",{"children":"Which health-insurance and student fees remain?"}],["$","li","Is a supervisor commitment required before admission?",{"children":"Is a supervisor commitment required before admission?"}]]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","Pearson 2027: nominate, apply, then complete the award",{"id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Pearson 2027: nominate, apply, then complete the award"}],[["$","p","For September 2027 entry, the University of Toronto's published schedule is 9 October 2026 for a school's nomination, 16 October for undergraduate admission and 6 November for the scholarship application. These dates are three distinct actions; the university issues the private scholarship form after school nomination.",{"children":"For September 2027 entry, the University of Toronto's published schedule is 9 October 2026 for a school's nomination, 16 October for undergraduate admission and 6 November for the scholarship application. These dates are three distinct actions; the university issues the private scholarship form after school nomination."}],["$","p","The award describes tuition, books, incidental fees and full residence support for four years. Confirm programme admission conditions and plan for any expenses not included in this published benefit list. Our dedicated Pearson guide breaks down the complete nomination sequence.",{"children":"The award describes tuition, books, incidental fees and full residence support for four years. Confirm programme admission conditions and plan for any expenses not included in this published benefit list. Our dedicated Pearson guide breaks down the complete nomination sequence."}]],"$undefined"]}]
1c:["$","section","Graduate funding: request a written breakdown",{"id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Graduate funding: request a written breakdown"}],[["$","p","Ask the programme or department whether the headline amount comes from a guaranteed stipend, a teaching assistantship, a supervisor's project or a competitive award. Confirm the term covered and what remains after tuition and compulsory charges.",{"children":"Ask the programme or department whether the headline amount comes from a guaranteed stipend, a teaching assistantship, a supervisor's project or a competitive award. Confirm the term covered and what remains after tuition and compulsory charges."}],["$","p","Estimate living expenses for the actual city, then ask whether a research supervisor must agree to support the application before admission. Undergraduate nomination advice does not transfer to this route.",{"children":"Estimate living expenses for the actual city, then ask whether a research supervisor must agree to support the application before admission. Undergraduate nomination advice does not transfer to this route."}]],"$undefined"]}]
